   "notes": "A rotating spray: bursts of projectiles fire from the centre (or inward from the rim), each emission rotated by stepDeg from the last. The rotation trend is visible from the first two emissions, so the player predicts the next burst instead of reacting to it. Legacy aliases: gapCount->arms, gapAngleDeg->startAngleDeg, gapArcDeg->burstArcDeg, rotationDeg added to start."
  },
