   "notes": "Arms reach the centre -- no dead hub -- so the safe zone is the moving wedge between arms and the play is orbiting it on the beat. reversalBeats > 0 turns the fan into a pendulum that sweeps an arc back and forth. Rotation is per beat, never per frame, so the sweep stays musical."
  },
