   "notes": "A wall crossing the arena whose window moves with the music. RHYTHM follows gapPath (one centre per beat) so the window steps on the pulse; SHRINK tightens the window as the wall travels; DOUBLE mirrors a second window. Window width and step speed are floored by fairness."
  },
  {
