   ],
   "defaults": {
    "mode": "COLLAPSE",
    "gapCount": 1,
    "gapArcDeg": 54,
    "gapAngleDeg": -90,
    "thickness": 0.07,
    "rotationDeg": 0
   },
   "notes": "A ring closing in on the centre (COLLAPSE) or pushing out from it (EXPAND), with a safe arc. Pairs well with A04 as a call and response. `variant` picks how the gap behaves across a `ringCount` sequence: BASIC_GAP holds it still, ROTATING_GAP walks it round, NARROWING_GAP shrinks it each ring, ADVANCED_ALTERNATING steps out and back. Gap width and gap-edge travel are both floored by fairness, so no variant can close the circle on the player."
  },
